              "subject": "[🔴 URGENT] Pipeline Alert: Landing Zone Extraction Failed",
              "body": "<p>Hello Data Engineering Team,</p>\n<p><strong>The Retail Clickstream Pipeline was stopped at Gate 1 (Landing Zone)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Issue: </strong>The Pipeline did not detect the expected .csv.gz files, or the total file size was below the minimum accepteble threshold. This indecates a potential silent faliure or delay in th upstream Azure Data Factory (ADF) ingestion.</p>\n<p><strong>Action Required:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Check ADF pipeline runs</li>\n  <li>Verify the landing Zone shortcut in OneLake.</li>\n  <li>Re-run the Fabric pipeline once the data is available&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>System Generated Microsoft Fabric</p>"
            },
